    "title": "WrestleMania 42 date, predicting matches for WrestleMania each night",
    "text": "Updated April 6, 2026, 6:06 p.m. ETEvery time we think we know what to expect, things completely change.WWE has loaded up the card for WrestleMania. And we still have two weeks to go before the big weekend. Last week, we watched Pat McAfee get involved in the Randy Orton vs. Cody Rhodes matchup, and CM Punk and Roman Reigns have been going at it for weeks, both on the mic and with punches.On April 7, WWE will announce live on ESPN who will wrestle on which night. Half of the matches will take place on Night 1, the rest of the show taking place on Night 2.We have no spoilers, we just have predictions. Here's when we think the matches will take place. In less than 24 hours, we'll know how accurate we are.When is WrestleMania 42?WrestleMania 42 will be held April 18 and 19.Where is WrestleMania 42?WrestleMania 42 will be held at Allegiant Stadium in Las Vegas.What time will WrestleMania 42 start?WrestleMania 42 is slated to start at 6 p.m. each night.Where to watch WrestleMania 42The first hour of each night of WrestleMania 42 will air on ESPN. The rest of the card will air on ESPN Unlimited.Who is hosting WrestleMania?John Cena will host WrestleMania 42.WrestleMania cardCM Punk vs. Roman Reigns for the World Heavyweight ChampionshipCody Rhodes vs. Randy Orton for the Undisputed ChampionshipStephanie Vaquer vs. Liv Morgan for the WWE Women's World ChampionshipJade Cargill vs. Rhea Ripley for the WWE Women's ChampionshipBrock Lesnar vs. Oba FemiAJ Lee vs. Becky Lynch for the Women's Intercontinental ChampionshipSami Zayn vs. Trick Williams for the United States ChampionshipDrew McIntyre vs. Jacob Fatu, unsanctioned matchSeth Rollins vs. GuntherPenta vs. Je'Von Evans vs. Dragon Lee vs. JD McDonagh vs. Rusev in a ladder match for the WWE championshipFinn Balor vs. Dominik MysterioNIa Jax and Lash Legend vs. Charlotte Flair and Alexa Bliss vs. Bayley and Lyra Valkyria vs. the Bella Twins for the WWE Women's Tag Team championship.Night 1 predictionsCody Rhodes vs. Randy Orton with Pat McAfee for the Undisputed ChampionshipJade Cargill vs. Rhea Ripley for the WWE Women's ChampionshipBrock Lesnar vs. Oba FemiSeth Rollins vs. GuntherPenta vs. Je'Von Evans vs. Dragon Lee vs. JD McDonagh vs. Rusev in a ladder match for the WWE championshipFinn Balor vs. Dominik MysterioNIa Jax and Lash Legend vs. Charlotte Flair and Alexa Bliss vs. Bayley and Lyra Valkyria vs. the Bella Twins for the WWE Women's Tag Team championship.Night 2 predictionsCM Punk vs. Roman Reigns for the World Heavyweight ChampionshipStephanie Vaquer vs. Liv Morgan for the WWE Women's World ChampionshipDrew McIntyre vs. Jacob Fatu, unsanctioned matchAJ Lee vs. Becky Lynch for the Women's Intercontinental ChampionshipSami Zayn vs. Trick Williams for the United States ChampionshipTBA match involving the Usos, Austin Theory and Logan Paul. LA Knight and IShowSpeed could be involved.Will the Rock be at WrestleMania?It doesn't appear so, so in wrestling, that means it's entirely possible.",
